# Auth Rules

Authentication is implemented through Better Auth and Next.js routes/middleware.

## Rules

- Shared setup lives in `libs/auth`.
- Next auth route lives in `apps/next-app/app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts`.
- Protected routes are configured in `apps/next-app/middlewares/authMiddleware.ts`.
- Sensitive API routes must resolve a session before doing user-scoped work.
